# Anti-de-Sitter space (AdS), the spacetime of the holographic duality, modeled by the kernel. AdS is the LORENTZIAN cousin
# of hyperbolic space: a spacetime of constant NEGATIVE curvature, the maximally symmetric solution of gravity with a
# negative cosmological constant. It is a hyperboloid in a flat space with TWO timelike directions, defined by
# X0^2 + X1^2 - X2^2 = 1 (signature two-plus, one-minus in this two-dimensional case). Its conformal boundary is one
# dimension lower, and the great discovery of AdS/CFT is that a gravity theory in the AdS BULK is exactly a conformal field
# theory on that boundary: the bulk is reconstructed from the boundary, holography made precise. The kernel checks sample
# points on the AdS hyperboloid and the defining bulk-equals-boundary-plus-one dimension relation. The substrate's
# growing hyperbolic mesh is the Euclidean version of this picture, its flat cusp the boundary.

# THE AdS HYPERBOLOID, the apex (1,0,0): X0^2 + X1^2 - X2^2 = 1 + 0 - 0 = 1. The nearest point of the spacetime.
hold ads-apex-on-hyperboloid
  call is-equal
    code 1
    call subtract
      call add
        call multiply
          code 1
          code 1
        call multiply
          code 0
          code 0
      call multiply
        code 0
        code 0

# A POINT ON AdS, (1,2,2): X0^2 + X1^2 - X2^2 = 1 + 4 - 4 = 1. A distinct point on the same constant-curvature spacetime,
# carried to the apex by an AdS isometry (the symmetry group SO(2,1)).
hold ads-point-one-two-two
  call is-equal
    code 1
    call subtract
      call add
        call multiply
          code 1
          code 1
        call multiply
          code 2
          code 2
      call multiply
        code 2
        code 2

# ANOTHER AdS POINT, (1,3,3): 1 + 9 - 9 = 1. The hyperboloid is a genuine curved surface, not a single point, with
# infinitely many points all at squared-distance one from the origin in the two-timelike metric.
hold ads-point-one-three-three
  call is-equal
    code 1
    call subtract
      call add
        call multiply
          code 1
          code 1
        call multiply
          code 3
          code 3
      call multiply
        code 3
        code 3

# AdS/CFT: the bulk gravity theory lives in one MORE dimension than the boundary conformal field theory. For a 4D boundary
# (our spacetime), the AdS bulk is 5-dimensional: 5 = 4 + 1. The boundary encodes the bulk, the same boundary-knows-volume
# relation the discrete holography file proves from the mesh shell counts.
hold ads-bulk-is-boundary-plus-one
  call is-equal
    code 5
    call add
      code 4
      code 1

# The negative cosmological constant sets a curvature RADIUS; the spacetime curves the same amount everywhere (maximal
# symmetry), the Lorentzian analogue of the constant negative curvature of the hyperbolic mesh. Here normalized to one:
# the squared radius is 1.
hold ads-constant-curvature-radius
  call is-equal
    code 1
    code 1
